const html = "<section class=\"page-hero\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n  <nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</li><li aria-current=\"page\">About</li></ol></nav>\r\n  <p class=\"eyebrow\">About</p>\r\n  <h1>A firm built by practitioners, not intermediaries.</h1>\r\n  <p class=\"lede\">VYSMIRA Solutions was founded on a straightforward observation: the organisations with the hardest hiring problems are usually served by the people least equipped to understand them.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"section\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n  <div class=\"split\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Who we are</p><h2>A deliberately small firm, by design.</h2></div>\r\n    <div class=\"prose reveal\" data-delay=\"80\">\r\n      <p>VYSMIRA Solutions is a specialist human capital firm headquartered in Bengaluru, working with organisations across India that build deep-technology and engineering teams.</p>\r\n      <p>We were established by two talent leaders who between them have spent 34 years inside the function &mdash; running talent acquisition for technology and engineering organisations, building hiring processes from the ground up, and hiring into the same skill markets we now serve our clients in.</p>\r\n      <p>The firm is deliberately small. Every mandate is led by a founder. There is no account-management layer between the person who understands your requirement and the person building your shortlist, because in specialist hiring that layer is where quality is lost.</p>\r\n      <h3>What &ldquo;boutique&rdquo; actually means here</h3>\r\n      <p>It means we take fewer mandates and go deeper on each one. It means we will decline work we don't believe we can deliver well &mdash; and we would rather say that at the first meeting than three months in. And it means the standard we're measured against is whether the team you built is still performing a year later, not whether an offer was signed.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"section section--dark\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n  <div class=\"split split--even\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal\">\r\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Vision</p>\r\n      <h2>To be the talent partner that India's technology and engineering organisations call first for the roles that matter most.</h2>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"reveal\" data-delay=\"80\">\r\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Mission</p>\r\n      <p class=\"lede\">To connect exceptional technical and leadership talent with organisations where it can do its best work &mdash; through domain expertise, disciplined process, and honest counsel.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"section section--alt\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n  <p class=\"eyebrow\">How we work</p>\r\n  <h2>Six things we hold to.</h2>\r\n  <div class=\"grid grid--3\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s-7)\"><div class=\"card reveal\"><h3>Integrity</h3><p>We tell clients what we think, not what closes the mandate. If a brief is unrealistic on compensation, timeline or availability, we say so at the start.</p></div><div class=\"card reveal\"><h3>Depth over volume</h3><p>We would rather present three well-argued candidates than thirty forwarded CVs. Volume is easy. Judgement is the service.</p></div><div class=\"card reveal\"><h3>Respect for candidates</h3><p>Every candidate is a professional making a significant decision. They get honest information, timely feedback and confidentiality — whether or not they take the role.</p></div><div class=\"card reveal\"><h3>Rigour</h3><p>Structured process, documented criteria, evidence-based assessment. Search should be repeatable, not intuitive.</p></div><div class=\"card reveal\"><h3>Continuous learning</h3><p>The technologies our clients hire for change constantly. Staying credible in those conversations is ongoing work, and we treat it as such.</p></div><div class=\"card reveal\"><h3>Partnership</h3><p>We are interested in the second mandate, not the first. Everything about how we work follows from that.</p></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"section\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n  <div class=\"split\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Roadmap</p><h2>Where we're going next.</h2></div>\r\n    <div class=\"prose reveal\" data-delay=\"80\">\r\n      <p>We're candid about the difference between what we do today and what we're building. Three things are in development:</p>\r\n      <h3>A talent intelligence capability</h3>\r\n      <p>We already use AI-assisted research and structured market analysis in our search work. We're building that into a more systematic capability &mdash; proprietary market maps and compensation data for the sectors we specialise in.</p>\r\n      <h3>A capability development practice</h3>\r\n      <p>A structured programme to train and certify early-career engineers into deployment-ready specialists, addressing the shortage at the entry level that every one of our clients describes.</p>\r\n      <h3>Technology products</h3>\r\n      <p>Longer term, we intend to build tools that solve problems we encounter daily in talent work.</p>\r\n      \r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"section section--alt\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n  <p class=\"eyebrow\">Credentials</p>\r\n  <h2>Certifications and professional development.</h2>\r\n  <ul class=\"tags\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s-5)\"><li>Google AI Essentials</li><li>Generative AI</li><li>AI for Talent Acquisition</li><li>Prompt Engineering</li><li>HR Analytics (IIM Rohtak)</li><li>ITIL Foundation</li></ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"cta-band\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n  <div class=\"split\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal\">\r\n      <h2>Let's talk about the team you're building.</h2>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"reveal\" data-delay=\"80\">\r\n      <p>Tell us the role, the constraint and the timeline. We'll tell you honestly whether we're the right firm for it &mdash; and if we're not, we'll say so.</p>\r\n      <div class=\"btn-row\">\r\n        <a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation</a>\r\n        <a class=\"btn btn--secondary\" href=\"tel:+917760342202\">Call +91 77603 42202</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>";

